      {
        "title": "Early Character Building",
        "body": "Begin by completing the main story chapters to unlock the reroll system and identify available rate-up banners. The starting character roster provides one free Special Grade selection; choose based on the current meta tier list (Gojo Satoru and Ryomen Sukuna are consistently top-tier across all content). Focus character upgrade resources on one primary damage dealer and one support before diversifying to secondary characters."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Cursed Technique Combo Building",
        "body": "Each character has a Cursed Technique unique to their canonical technique (Gojo's Infinity, Itadori's Divergent Fist, Megumi's Shikigami). In mid-game content, building team compositions around Cursed Technique synergies (characters whose techniques chain together for increased stagger or CE drain effects) outperforms simply using the highest individual damage dealers. Study the technique interaction tooltips carefully before forming party compositions."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Culling Game and Special Grade Content",
        "body": "The Culling Game endgame events replicate the anime's Culling Game arc with stage-based progression and unique rule modifiers per stage. Special Grade difficulty stages require fully Limit Broken characters with optimized Technique Load-out; single failed Limit Break can result in a DPS shortfall that prevents clearing timed damage checks in late Culling Game stages."
      }
